Drop the <miniz/miniz.h> include and the About-window miniz entry. The
bundled miniz from libchdr/deps/miniz-3.1.1 doesn't expose its header
under the "miniz/" subdir that vcpkg's port uses, and miniz is private to
libchdr — the About listing is purely informational, so removing it is
simpler than wiring up a public include path.

--- a/apps/ymir-sdl3/src/app/ui/windows/about_window.cpp
